<li>Prepare your <code>.mcpb</code> bundle</li>
<li>Publish the bundle to Smithery</li>
<li>Complete the publishing flow</li>
</ol><div role="note" aria-label="Tip" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-green-200 bg-green-50 dark:border-green-900 dark:bg-green-600/20 [&amp;_[data-component-part=&#x27;callout-icon&#x27;]]:mt-px" data-callout-type="tip"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4.5 text-green-800 dark:text-green-300"><path d="M 4.0216 15.9727 C 4.0216 16.1941 4.0855 16.4101 4.2074 16.5947 L 4.81 17.4979 C 4.9946 17.7747 5.4137 18 5.7467 18 H 7.9149 C 8.2468 18 8.6659 17.775 8.8505 17.4979 L 9.451 16.5951 C 9.5543 16.439 9.6391 16.1601 9.6391 15.9727 L 9.6436 14.5945 H 4.0181 L 4.0216 15.9727 Z M 6.8308 0 C 3.2453 0.0113 0.6429 2.9171 0.6429 6.1563 C 0.6429 7.7167 1.2209 9.1392 2.1744 10.2278 C 2.7556 10.8901 3.663 12.2751 4.0104 13.443 C 4.0115 13.4518 4.0137 13.4612 4.0148 13.4706 H 9.6473 C 9.6483 13.4612 9.6505 13.4524 9.6517 13.443 C 9.9988 12.2751 10.9065 10.8901 11.4877 10.2278 C 12.4422 9.1695 13.0189 7.749 13.0189 6.1563 C 13.0189 2.7705 10.2483 0.0001 6.8308 0 Z M 10.2202 9.1449 C 9.6696 9.7724 8.9882 10.7727 8.4956 11.8131 H 5.1692 C 4.6766 10.7727 3.9953 9.7724 3.445 9.1452 C 2.7257 8.3257 2.3305 7.2463 2.3305 6.1563 C 2.3305 3.9835 4.0216 1.6964 6.7992 1.6876 C 9.3131 1.6876 11.3312 3.7058 11.3312 6.1563 C 11.3312 7.2463 10.9374 8.3257 10.2202 9.1449 Z M 6.2683 2.8127 C 4.7178 2.8127 3.4556 4.0749 3.4556 5.6254 C 3.4556 5.9364 3.7072 6.188 4.0181 6.188 C 4.3291 6.188 4.5807 5.9348 4.5807 5.6254 C 4.5807 4.6948 5.3376 3.9378 6.2683 3.9378 C 6.5792 3.9378 6.8308 3.6865 6.8308 3.3756 C 6.8308 3.0647 6.5777 2.8127 6.2683 2.8127 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-green-800 dark:text-green-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">For MCPB authoring guidance, see Anthropic’s <a href="https://claude.com/docs/connectors/building/mcpb" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Build a desktop extension with MCPB</a> guide and the <a href="https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/mcpb" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">MCPB specification</a>.</span></div></div><h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="what-gets-published"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#what-gets-published" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">What gets published</span></h3><ul>
<li><code>server.mcpb</code> — the MCPB bundle distributed to clients</li>
<li>Configuration schema and metadata used to render your Smithery server page</li>
<li>The latest downloadable stdio artifact for local installation</li>
</ul><details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden py-4 px-5 [&amp;&gt;div]:ml-2 [&amp;&gt;div]:mr-0 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-t-xl" aria-controls="api-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="api" class="absolute top-[-7rem]"></div><div class="mr-0.5" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! h-3 w-3 transition bg-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-400 duration-75" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/solid/caret-right.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/solid/caret-right.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="leading-tight text-left w-full" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="accordion-title-container"><p id="api-accordion-title" class="m-0 font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" data-component-part="accordion-title">API</p></div></summary><div id="api-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="api-accordion-title" class="mt-2 mb-4 mx-6 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p">Smithery accepts multipart <code>bundle</code> uploads for stdio releases. See <a class="link" href="/docs/api-reference/servers/publish-a-server">Publish a server</a>.</span></div></details><details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden py-4 px-5 [&amp;&gt;div]:ml-2 [&amp;&gt;div]:mr-0 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-t-xl" aria-controls="cli-advanced-1-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="cli-advanced-1" class="absolute top-[-7rem]"></div><div class="mr-0.5" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! h-3 w-3 transition bg-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-400 duration-75" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/solid/caret-right.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/solid/caret-right.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="leading-tight text-left w-full" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="accordion-title-container"><p id="cli-advanced-1-accordion-title" class="m-0 font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" data-component-part="accordion-title">CLI (Advanced)</p></div></summary><div id="cli-advanced-1-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="cli-advanced-1-accordion-title" class="mt-2 mb-4 mx-6 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p">Publish a bundle with:</span><div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" numberOfLines="1" language="shellscript"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="code-block-copy-button z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_fjbt1i